---
title: "liquidate (Compound Whitepaper)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: liquidator calls liquidate(borrower, collateralAsset, closeAmount)
    q_validate --> q_accrue_both: closeAmount > 0 and borrower != msg.sender
    q_validate --> q_error_input: closeAmount = 0 or borrower = msg.sender
    q_accrue_both --> q_check_shortfall: accrueInterest() on both borrow and collateral markets
    q_check_shortfall --> q_calc_capacity: compute borrower account liquidity
    q_calc_capacity --> q_check_underwater: shortfall = totalBorrowValue - borrowingCapacity
    q_check_underwater --> q_check_close_factor: shortfall > 0 (borrower is underwater)
    q_check_underwater --> q_error_healthy: shortfall <= 0 (borrower is healthy)
    q_check_close_factor --> q_calc_close: maxClose = borrowBalance * closeFactor
    q_calc_close --> q_check_amount: actualClose = min(closeAmount, maxClose)
    q_check_amount --> q_calc_seize: actualClose > 0
    q_calc_seize --> q_transfer_in: seizeTokens = (actualClose * liquidationIncentive * priceBorrow) / (priceCollateral * exchangeRateCollateral)
    q_transfer_in --> q_repay: transferFrom(msg.sender, borrowMarket, actualClose)
    q_repay --> q_seize: borrowBalance[borrower] = borrowBalance[borrower] - actualClose
    q_seize --> [*]: cTokenBalance[borrower] -= seizeTokens; cTokenBalance[msg.sender] += seizeTokens
    q_error_input --> [*]: revert
    q_error_healthy --> [*]: revert borrower not underwater

    note right of q_check_underwater
        INV-001: liquidation can only proceed when borrower borrowing exceeds borrowing capacity
        INV-002: shortfall = sum(borrowBalance_i * price_i) - sum(cTokenBalance_j * exchangeRate_j * price_j * collateralFactor_j)
    end note

    note right of q_calc_close
        INV-003: closeAmount must not exceed borrowBalance * closeFactor (partial liquidation)
        INV-004: closeFactor is in range (0, 1]
    end note

    note right of q_seize
        INV-005: seizeTokens includes liquidation discount (incentive for liquidator)
        INV-006: liquidator receives cTokens at better-than-market price
        INV-007: total cToken supply unchanged during seize (transfer, not mint/burn)
    end note
